<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon raises Echlin.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon raises Echlin.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Echlin Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The analyst declined immediate comment.</p>
<p>-- Earlier the company said Frederick Mancheski retired as chairman and chief executive.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 3-1/4 at 34.  </p>
<p>-- In a research note issued later, Salomon analyst Darren Kimball said Mancheski's retirement &quot;marks the beginning of a new era for Echlin.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Said has a $40 12-month target on the stock.</p>
</text>
